2.54.0

Add PHY driver for the USB3 PHY found on CIX Sky1 SoCs. The driver
handles initialization, reset, and clock management for the
multi-port USB3 PHY.

Signed-off-by: Hongliang Yang <hongliang.yang@cixtech.com>
